# Working notes that land at the package root: audit and review reports,
# capability summaries, fix specs. They are legitimate artefacts and must
# not ship in the tarball -- an unignored one raises a "Non-standard
# file/directory found at top level" NOTE. Matched on the report-type
# infix rather than on a shouting-case filename pattern, which would also
# have caught NEWS.md and README.md and dropped them from the build.
^.*_AUDIT_.*\.md$
^.*_REVIEW_.*\.md$
^.*_SUMMARY_.*\.md$
^.*_FIX_SPEC_.*\.md$
^validation$
^review$
^inst/extdata/inla-verification/
